e trying to save somebody else so  it was  [Applause]  i mean do you believe in angels  yeah i do i do a lot of people call me  an angel but i just feel like  i just did the right thing you really  are  an angel and i i mean i just i believe  there are humans masquerading  as angels i believe that there is  capacity  in a human but to sit here and hear your  story  i mean you are what i think people  need to believe in we need to believe in  angels in human form  i i i just okay so everyone ended up  okay  yeah everybody ended okay to mom at one  point she couldn't really breathe  correctly but  the um paramedics helped out gave her  more oxygen so she can actually start  breathing correctly and  she was just grateful that i was there  the kids was grateful  um it was i'm i was just happy that they  were all safe i'm glad that i was safe  i'm glad everybody at that air in the  area was safe  nobody really got home but i mean you  saved an entire family  i i i just i'm sorry i'm i'm really i am  just in awe of you and um the mayor  of um waterbury connecticut  went where this happened when he heard  what you did  he wanted to do something for you so he  asked me  to give you this proclamation of the  town  in honor of your bravery um  and that's not all when we heard um that  you had a particular favorite basketball  player he also heard  what you did and he had this to say it's  carmelo anthony  what yo justin it's carmelo anthony here  bruh  i heard about your story man i want to  let you know how inspiring and  courageous you are man you're a true  true hero you've inspired me man and i'm  so inspired to have someone like you  supporting me throughout my career um i  appreciate it more than you even know  i also heard you a sneaker head like me  so we're going to hook you up with some  joint brands  uh merch as a small thank you for the  big things that you've been doing man  um and that you continue to do so you  know i'll leave you with this  um you know just keep pushing man keep  persevering  keep making your family proud again  thank you  for what you did and just know we all  rooting for you man  and know you're going to continue to do  great things  peace stay mellow  [Applause]  we also found out that you're a fan of  the brooklyn nets and they  wanted to say thank you too so  oh so we have hooked you all  up we're getting you season passes go to  all the games the players are excited to  meet you  and really there's just not enough that  we can do here at this show there's no  way  to sort of monetize or match your act of  saving an entire family but we just  wanted to  start in some way and everybody joined  in  and we just are in awe of you honestly  thank you so much thank you justin  you
 

